{"id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md","title":"Ultrapower","display":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ultrapower","aliases":["58-df-ultrapower"],"display":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower","depends_on":["[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ultrapower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ultrapower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (structure or transitive model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (index set cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{U,M,\\kappa}\">\\(R_{U,M,\\kappa}\\)</span> (equivalence relation induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to R_{U,M,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in M^\\kappa\\times M^\\kappa:\\{i\\in\\kappa:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to R_{U,M,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in M^\\kappa\\times M^\\kappa:\\{i\\in\\kappa:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R_{U,M,\\kappa},M^\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R_{U,M,\\kappa},M^\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to M^\\kappa/U\\coloneqq(M^\\kappa)/R_{U,M,\\kappa}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to M^\\kappa/U\\coloneqq(M^\\kappa)/R_{U,M,\\kappa}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{U,M,\\kappa}\">\\(R_{U,M,\\kappa}\\)</span> identifies functions equal on a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-large set; the displayed quotient defines the ultrapower universe. Interpretations of function and relation symbols are induced coordinatewise in the usual downstream structure construction.</li>\n<li>Los theorem gives elementarity for every ultrafilter; fineness is an additional property used in particular large-cardinal constructions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ (ultrafilter on $\\kappa$, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[58-df-equivalence-relation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"R_{U,M,\\kappa}","